# What the detector image's build may see. The build starts at the repo's top folder, so everything
# else (.venv, models, data, the .env with your API keys ...) is left out here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!shared
!raspberry_pi/detector_service
!raspberry_pi/health_check.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
